description:
Design a parity generator module that computes the parity of a given input vector. The module takes an input of arbitrary width (default is 8 bits) and produces an output based on the defined parity mode. It can generate odd parity, even parity, a constant '1', or a constant '0', determined by the parameter `Parity`. The output will reflect the selected parity calculation whenever the input changes, allowing for effective error detection in digital communication systems.
module top_module(
    input [Width-1:0] In,
    output reg Out
);

